# SPA fallback — every path must serve index.html so client-side routing works.
#
# The app uses BrowserRouter with real paths (/templates, /projects/:id/editor,
# /settings). Without this, those only work when reached by clicking from "/":
# a direct visit, a refresh, or a shared link asks the CDN for a file that does
# not exist and gets a 404.
#
# Read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify. Render Static Sites use a dashboard
# rewrite rule instead: source /* → destination /index.html, action Rewrite.
/*    /index.html   200
